ifacts) match the actual Git change set attributed to the spec trailer (POSE-Spec: <slug>).\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Specification slug to reconcile\n  --from <rev>             Starting git revision for change set comparison\n  --to <rev>               Ending git revision for change set comparison\n  --strict                 Fail on any undeclared or missing artifact mismatch\n  --json                   Output reconciliation results in JSON format\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose artifact-check --spec user-auth --strict\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
